WEBVTT

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.480
Miss Pandora.

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.330
Is that you, Rhadamanthys?

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:39.610
Yes. Miss Pandora.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:43.930
It is Rhadamanthys of Wyvern.

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:47.040
What is your business?

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:53.980
Yes, I have come to request you to dispatch me to Athena's Sanctuary.

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:59.080
I have already assigned that matter to the Saints.

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:03.470
Do you think you can depend on them?

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:09.160
Compared to the Specters, Athena's Saints are like insects.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:10.860
Please.

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:15.290
Grant me the permission.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:20.620
I'll take Athena's life in less than an hour.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.850
So please allow me to leave.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.370
I will not.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:30.630
Lord Hades is kind-hearted.

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:37.110
He would hate to see his Specters get injured.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:38.010
However.

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:39.860
Rhadamanthys.

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:46.050
Do you question Lord Hades?

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:47.160
No.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.210
Of course not.

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.970
Then wait quietly.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.530
In another 12 hours,

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:59.830
108 Specters will be intact.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:04.650
And we will have Athena's life in our hands.

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:08.270
Yes.

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:18.850
The Shadow of the One Who Struggles

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:27.820
I never thought Old Master would come.

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:30.510
There's nothing more reassuring.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:37.350
But what did he mean by his order to protect Athena for 12 hours?

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:43.050
Twelve hours until the clock tower fires go out.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.550
When 12 hours pass...

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:48.040
It's an illusion.

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:52.880
Could it be my master Shion and Saga will?

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:56.690
No, there's no time to be thinking that.

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:59.390
Aldebaran is in the Taurus house,

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:02.780
he will guard it no matter what happens.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:21.890
Brother.

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:30.490
Brother!

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:39.050
Brother.

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:45.910
I wonder what happened to brother Ikki

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:47.670
since the Temple of Poseidon?

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:52.210
I'm sure he's all right.

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:05.980
I wonder what Seiya is doing?

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:11.900
He was off to Greece to ask Marin about his missing sister, Seika.

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:14.670
I wonder if he found his sister.

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:19.740
I'm praying that you can find your sister...

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:21.940
Seiya.

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:32.470
Again. I feel a Cosmo from the distant Sanctuary.

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:39.040
What is this eerie Cosmo?

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:43.580
I must go to the Sanctuary.

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:48.500
Miss Saori, Athena is in the Sanctuary.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:01.890
Tatsumi.

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:06.820
Where are you going with the Andromeda Cloth?

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:08.090
To the Sanctuary.

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.790
That is unnecessary.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:10.620
Huh?

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:15.680
You, Seiya, Shiryu, Hyoga and Ikki,

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:18.550
are not to approach the Sanctuary from now on.

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:23.660
If you do, Athena will grant you death.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:25.870
That's a lie.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:29.830
It's a lie, it's a lie. That decree is a lie!

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:34.120
Miss Saori's orders are absolute.

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:38.110
Thus, I will not allow you to go to the Sanctuary!

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.250
Even if you try to block me, I'll go.

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:47.180
Because I am Athena's Saint.

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:48.800
Shun.

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:52.970
If you insist on going,

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:57.160
it'll be after you defeat me, Tatsumi Tokumaru.

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:02.620
Tatsumi's Tokumaru strike!

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:10.350
I'm sorry, Tatsumi.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.210
Shun.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:31.320
Aldebaran.

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:36.520
Odd. I can't sense the Cosmo of the battle.

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:40.730
A battle between two Gold Saints shouldn't be so quiet.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.110
Aldebaran.

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:01.010
You were all right.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.340
Aldebaran.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:23.280
Aldebaran.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:29.030
You remained in order to guard Taurus house even in your death.

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:33.550
Even you, who is peerless amongst Gold Saints,

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:39.490
could not stop a simultaneous attack by Saga, Camus and Shura.

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:45.800
This is Aldebaran's final Cosmo.

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:54.800
There is no trace of a fight or a scar on the Taurus Cloth.

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:58.720
So how did Aldebaran die?

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:02.720
He couldn't have been unharmed against Saga and the others.

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:04.380
Could it be?

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.680
Yes, it could.

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:12.330
Saga and the others aren't the only Specters to come here.

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:18.230
Saga and the others only passed by the immobile Taurus.

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.510
Of course, the one who incapacitated Taurus,

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:25.040
and the one who finished him off...

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:27.430
It is all...

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:29.890
My doing!

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:41.570
The Dark Star, Deep Niobe!

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:49.530
With Aldebaran's flesh gone, the Taurus Cloth is useless.

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:53.330
Aldebaran.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:10.450
Miss Pandora is clueless!

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:13.060
Rhadamanthys.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:14.540
Zelos.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:20.650
Yes, it's Strange Star, Frog Zelos.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:26.480
As you ordered,

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:30.840
I've sent several Specters to the Sanctuary.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.090
Good.

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:36.960
Are you sure it's all right?

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:37.910
What?

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:40.440
Commanding the Specters without Miss Pandora's permission

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:43.670
may have troublesome consequences.

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:48.340
It doesn't concern you!

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:52.360
I don't trust those Saints.

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:57.100
As long as we get Athena's head, it's fine.

00:11:57.330 --> 00:11:59.830
Then it's all good.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:04.430
Miss Pandora is as fearsome as she is beautiful.

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:08.900
That's why I was just worried for you.

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:13.370
You're right, the Saints are not to be trusted.

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:28.520
Fool, you should have gotten out of the way sooner.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:31.430
We have business with Lord Hades.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:49.110
What is your deal?

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:51.630
We don't have to answer to you.

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:53.820
We are here to ask Lord Hades for permission.

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:59.660
Lord Hades doesn't have time for weaklings like you.

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:02.700
Failure is not acceptable.

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:07.140
You two will be kicked back to hell!

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.540
What did you say?

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:10.890
Do it if you can.

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:16.340
Piranhian Rose!

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:22.240
What the... ?

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:24.730
You go to hell!

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:28.480
Layers of Death!

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:30.320
Fool.

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:35.800
Damn it.

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.280
Ridiculous.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:44.580
What is the Layers of Death to one of the Underworld's Big Three?

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:51.290
I'll show you how you're supposed to use the Layers of Death.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:06.010
I'm getting sucked in!

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.760
Where are we?

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:24.490
It's the Yomotsu.

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:25.170
Yes.

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:30.120
It's the death hole that you will fall into!

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:33.710
Help me.

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:37.280
No way. I don't want to go back to hell.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.080
Gutless!

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.530
Stop it!

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:04.150
Please make it stop.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:08.870
I expect nothing from you two. Better you die!

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:17.400
Imbeciles!

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:23.600
If these are the ultimate Gold Saints, they're ridiculous.

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:27.120
The Hades army pawns are better off.

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:32.030
Never return from hell.

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:40.130
I see. It's not just Saga and the others,

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:43.670
but the Specters have entered too.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:48.760
Exactly, Saga and the others were just the guides.

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:51.220
Really?

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:52.290
What?

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:56.270
You guys might be slowing Saga and the others down.

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:57.520
Nonsense.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:02.000
I'll kill you here just like Taurus.

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:04.760
What's this smell?

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:09.660
Deep Fragrance!

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:16.300
My body is numbing and I'm losing consciousness.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:21.080
Aldebaran must have experienced the same thing.

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.290
I can't breathe this in.

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:32.350
It's no use.

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:34.350
Even if you stop breathing,

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:37.260
the fragrance will enter through your skin.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:42.270
It'll wreak havoc on your nerves and paralyze you.

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:47.690
It will put you to your final sleep within a few minutes.

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:54.660
Farewell, Aries.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:58.330
Gold Saints aren't much.

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:01.000
I've taken care of two already.

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:04.820
What is this? Since when?

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:13.840
What just happened?

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:15.750
Crystal wall.

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:21.790
No one can pass this invisible wall.

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:24.950
Crystal wall? Impossible.

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:29.780
The Deep Fragrance didn't penetrate it?

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:34.000
Wait, where are you going, Aries?

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:36.330
Our fight hasn't begun!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:41.120
I can't fight something that's already dead.

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:45.790
What? What do you mean by already dead?

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:52.540
Do you think Aldebaran would be defeated without taking down one enemy?

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:07.950
Yes.

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:45.470
Great Horn!

00:18:57.170 --> 00:19:01.810
When you thought you killed Aldebaran with your Deep Fragrance,

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:08.290
your body was torn apart by Aldebaran's Great Horn.

00:19:09.570 --> 00:19:13.320
Impossible. My body was torn apart?

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:16.350
No way.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:25.800
Aldebaran.

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:30.940
Your silent hint has saved me.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:35.400
By feeling the Taurus Cloth's Cosmo,

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:39.820
I was able to avoid its attack.

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:46.410
Thank you. I will not let your death be in vain.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:50.490
I will protect Athena.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:55.830
Please look over us as a star.

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:01.850
Quickly.

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:05.360
Quickly, to the Sanctuary.

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.040
Who is it?

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:12.010
Headed to the Sanctuary?

00:20:12.070 --> 00:20:14.950
Well done, Andromeda.

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:15.970
Who are you?

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:17.490
Your enemy!

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:27.360
No way.

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:30.330
Dios, Argethi, Sirius.

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.350
You were supposed to be dead.

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:33.740
We've been resurrected.

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:35.290
Thanks to Lord Hades.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:41.090
What we do with your body will prove we're alive.

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:53.720
No, I don't want to fight. I don't want to hurt anyone.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:56.480
Shut up, you're breaking my heart.

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:06.310
Kornephoros!

00:21:12.150 --> 00:21:15.590
Great Mountain Smasher!

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:25.460
We won't make you suffer,

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:31.010
because eternal suffering awaits you.

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:34.790
I need to go to the Sanctuary.

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:37.750
There's no time to be wasting here.

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:41.100
Because Seiya, Hyoga, Shiryu

00:21:41.100 --> 00:21:45.350
and brother Ikki are headed to protect Miss Saori.

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:52.220
So I can't just hang around here!

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:06.660
The Andromeda Nebula.

00:22:07.040 --> 00:22:10.580
If you are prepared to die, enter. However...

00:22:10.860 --> 00:22:13.540
I don't want to hurt anybody.

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:18.390
Don't talk big just because you have that Cloth on!

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:20.610
Nebula Chain!

00:22:34.630 --> 00:22:36.320
We Silver Saints.

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:38.860
Three at once.

00:22:39.870 --> 00:22:41.740
Hmm. Not bad.

00:22:44.520 --> 00:22:46.030
In these 12 houses...

00:22:46.030 --> 00:22:49.490
Knowing that the Specters have intruded, I can't let my guard down.

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:52.790
I need to hurry to the Gemini house.

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:56.350
What is this?

00:22:56.740 --> 00:23:00.640
I feel a tremendously big Cosmo from the Gemini house.

00:23:01.810 --> 00:23:05.150
It should be empty, so what is it?

00:23:06.720 --> 00:23:10.260
I feel a righteous force that won't let evil pass.

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:13.280
This isn't a Cosmo.

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:15.490
Who is it?

00:23:16.030 --> 00:23:20.550
Who is guarding the empty house?

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:28.290
Saga.

00:23:28.710 --> 00:23:31.280
You guys go ahead.

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:32.710
However...

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:35.520
I'll take care of this.

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:38.720
I can't believe he's alive.

00:23:40.350 --> 00:23:43.910
And to stand before me once again.

00:25:01.490 --> 00:25:04.760
Saint Seiya

00:25:05.660 --> 00:25:09.160
The Gemini Gold Cloth who protects the supposedly empty house.

00:25:09.160 --> 00:25:12.610
The man who was once tainted by evil and attempted to destroy the world.

00:25:12.610 --> 00:25:15.650
Are you really protecting Athena?

00:25:15.780 --> 00:25:18.110
On the other hand, in Eastern Siberia,

00:25:18.110 --> 00:25:19.680
Hyoga feels an abnormal Cosmo.

00:25:19.790 --> 00:25:23.830
There, three shadows approach. Are you guys with Hades too?

00:25:24.040 --> 00:25:25.210
Saint Seiya.

00:25:25.210 --> 00:25:26.440
Episode 4: Transient Meeting

00:25:26.570 --> 00:25:29.140
Do you sense the Cosmo?
